The '''Cliffside Veins''' is a [[Location]] of the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Cliffside Veins''' serves as a place to go [[Mining]] for [[Mithril]] and [[Titanium]]. Towards the top of it, the [[Cult of the Fallen Star]] can be found within a small cave.

